                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21a5d8da-2725-32c0-88f3-ebdc830d3c91",
                        "entry_id": "5b4ce7e6-d490-3b66-a5a0-7d581de44d74",
                        "glosses": [
                            "feel out"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ab090bb-a7fa-48a6-bb05-48fa6e2a8c9f",
                                "sense_id": "21a5d8da-2725-32c0-88f3-ebdc830d3c91",
                                "text": "Он как бу́дто оста́вил меня́ в поко́е вози́ться с входя́щими и исходя́щими реги́страми и протоко́лами, но тем не ме́нее я всё́-таки чу́вствовал, что вокру́г меня́ что́-то копоши́тся, что лю́ди выщу́пывают, с како́й бы стороны́ меня́ улови́ть и пото́м, вероя́тно, запу́тать.",
                                "translation": "He seemed to leave me in peace to busy myself with incoming and outgoing records and minutes, but nonetheless I kept feeling that something was going on around me, that people were trying to feel out which side to catch me from, and then, probably, to ensnare me.",
                                "english": "He seemed to leave me in peace to busy myself with incoming and outgoing records and minutes, but nonetheless I kept feeling that something was going on around me, that people were trying to feel out which side to catch me from, and then, probably, to ensnare me."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
